  {
   "ID": "card-files",
   "Title": "Which file holds which fact",
   "Color": "orange",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "**model.yaml** · elements and zones, connections (flow, auth, tunnel, async, denied), references, gaps, status, multiplicity",
    "**views/\u003cid\u003e.yaml** · include, steps [1] and [A], label overrides, cards, notes, participants (sequence)",
    "**layouts/\u003cview-id\u003e.yaml** · canvas, positions relative to the parent zone, endpoints id.side@ratio, named lanes",
    "A view's model is the model.yaml of its directory. Every id a view or layout uses must exist there.",
    "A reviewer reads model.yaml and views/; layouts/ churns without hiding facts."
   ],
   "X": 720,
   "Y": 760,
   "W": 1160,
   "H": 300
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-steps",
   "Title": "Pipeline · one render",
   "Color": "cyan",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "[1] The loader parses the three files strictly and checks every id reference; JSON Schemas validate the same files in go test.",
    "[2] The resolver gets the model, the view and its layout.",
    "[3] It emits absolute geometry: points, labels '[n] verb · protocol', gap badges.",
    "[4] The v0 geometry rules check it, with the same messages.",
    "[5] Only a clean diagram reaches the renderer.",
    "[6] One draw.io file per theme, [7] exported to PNG."
   ],
   "X": 1920,
   "Y": 760,
   "W": 1140,
   "H": 300
  }
 ],
